  comment: ; note COLUMN 21 PIN AU2 is PNP hi side driver; can not test
  comment: ; I/O CLEAR hi
  comment: ; (READER RUN SET-N) low to set READER RUN (not normal powerup)
  comment: ; (STOP SET-N) low to set STOP 1 and STOP 2 (not normal powerup)
  comment: ; IN LAST UNIT CLEAR-N low to clear CLOCK SCALE 1 and CLOCK SCALE 2
